<completion>
Eddie Izzard, Dress To Kill

[Neil Armstrong] could have been there saying, "Hi. People on the moon, as you can see. [...] Over to my right, I can see — a fucking monster! There’s a monster behind me!" [...] Buzz Aldrin in a monster outfit. Neil doing close-up, "They’ve got me, Houston. The monster’s caught me. [...] He wants cash. For release of my life, send a million — two million dollars. Leave it in a bag by the Sea of Tranquility."
</completion>
<solution>
Neil Armstrong could have been there saying, "Hi. People on the moon, as you can see. Over to my right, I can see — a fucking monster! There’s a monster behind me!" Buzz Aldrin in a monster outfit. Neil doing close-up, "They’ve got me, Houston. The monster’s caught me. He wants cash. For release of my life, send a million — two million dollars. Leave it in a bag by the Sea of Tranquility."
</solution>
<source>
Eddie Izzard, Dress To Kill
</source>
